EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Your intent to claim for {!Case.Freight_AWB_Number__c} has been submitted
Reference number: {!Case.CaseNumber}


Thank you for completing the first step of our claims process.

This is not a formal claim yet as we still need a few details from you. Without these, there may be a delay with processing your request.

Next step: lodge a formal claim To lodge a formal claim, you’ll need to provide additional information. For more details on the required information, please refer to Claims Help on our website.   Formal claims must be lodged within a specified timeframe which vary depending on the type of claim. Further information is available on our website in our Conditions of Carriage (outside of Australia).

Where to send this information  Claims for international shipments (eligible for receivers only)

If the final destination is within Australia or New Zealand, reply to this email with the additional information required and quote the AWB details in the subject line.
If the final destination is within the United States, send an email to qffreightusa@qantas.com.au with the additional information required and quote the AWB details in the subject line.
If the final destination is outside Australia or New Zealand or the US, the receiver must contact their local Qantas Freight office or ground handling agent and follow their claims process as local regulations vary.

Your shipment details

Air waybill:   {!Case.Freight_AWB_Number__c}
House air waybill:   {!Case.Freight_House_AWB_Num__c}
Lodgement reason:   {!Case.Request_Reason__c}
Supplementary lodgement reason:   {!Case.Description}
Estimated damages:   {!Case.Refund_Amount__c}
Number of affected pieces:   {!Case.freight_num_of_Affected_Pieces__c}
Weight of affected pieces:   {!Case.Freight_Weight__c}
Claimant name:   {!Case.SuppliedName}
Contact number:   {!Case.SuppliedPhone}
Company name:   {!Case.SuppliedCompany}

A reminder that specific time limitations apply for lodging your formal claim.    We’re here to help If you need assistance with lodging a formal claim or have any further questions, get in touch with our Customer Service Team at +1 800 227 0290 (Toll free within USA only) during business hours or reply to this email.   Thank you for your patience as we work to resolve your claim.    Qantas Freight   {!Case.Thread_Token}
